# Cloudflare Pages headers
#
# NOTE on framing: CF Pages MERGES all matching rules cumulatively (a more
# specific block does NOT override a general one). So we must NOT lock framing
# on /* and try to open it on /embed/* — both rules would apply and the
# restrictive frame-ancestors would win, breaking the embed widget. Since this
# is a stateless tool site (no auth / no sensitive session), we intentionally do
# NOT set a global framing lock; instead /embed/* is explicitly declared
# framable so the backlink widget works everywhere. (If a page ever needs
# clickjack protection, scope frame-ancestors to that exact path, never /*.)

/*
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin

# Embeddable widget pages: explicitly framable by any site (the backlink engine).
/embed/*
  Content-Security-Policy: frame-ancestors *
